ilePath":76,"digest":77},{"description_paragraph1":59,"description_paragraph2":60,"description_paragraph3":61,"eventLocation":62,"polaroidCardImages":63,"carouselImages":65},"Workshops take place at Olive Tree Mansion, a luxury villa just 400 meters from Jadro Beach on the beautiful island of Vir. Surrounded by olive trees, it offers an outdoor pool and a rooftop terrace with a sea view for relaxing after workshops.","Each apartment has a private bathroom, air conditioning, and access to a shared kitchen, dining area, and Wi-Fi. Located in a quiet part of Vir, the villa has everything you need for a pleasant stay – with Zadar Airport just 40 km away and easily accessible via the bridge.","Along with comfortable accommodations, the workshop includes delicious and fresh breakfasts, lunches, dinners, and soft drinks.","Olive Tree Mansion, Vir Island, Croatia",[64,64],"/media/venue-section-img-main.webp",[66,67,68,69,70,71,72,73,74,75],"/media/venue-section-carousel-1.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-2.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-3.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-4.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-5.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-6.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-7.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-8.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-9.webp","/media/venue-section-carousel-10.webp","src/content/venue/venue.yaml","29c12517ce08bd0c","agenda",["Map",78,80],{"id":78,"data":81,"filePath":103,"digest":104},{"startDay":82,"events":83},6,[84,87,90,93,95,97,99,101],{"title":85,"description":86},"Check-in and welcome dinner.","TBA",{"title":88,"description":89},"A free day with a volcano trekking trip in Teide National Park.","123",{"title":91,"description":92},"Let's start the workshops!","You'll explore Expo Router for efficient navigation and authentication patterns, replicating real-world app structures. Dive into Expo Application Services (EAS) to streamline builds, set up advanced error tracking with Sentry, learn how to manage environment variables and secrets securely, and implement seamless Over-The-Air (OTA) updates. Plus, you'll explore the Expo's brand-new features. Whether you're enhancing your abilities or discovering the newest Expo innovations, these sessions will provide you with practical tools to create improved React Native applications.",{"title":94,"description":86},"The following day will offer an in-depth exploration of the world of native platforms. You will learn how to create your own native views and modules usin...",{"title":96,"description":86},"On this day we will focus on the performance of your applications! You can expect to debug your code with brand-new utils such as React Native dev tool...",{"title":98,"description":86},"On the final day of our workshop, well explore the ecosystem of Software Mansion libraries, with a particular focus on react-native-reanimated. You'll disc...",{"title":100,"description":86},"Consulting Day - use this day to consult our experts on challenges you encountered during the workshops or while building your apps. Ask them for",{"title":102,"description":86},"Check-out","src/content/agenda/agenda.yaml","dfc45fdd82f52f3a","previousEditions",["Map",105,107],{"id":105,"data":108,"filePath":120,"digest":121},{"polaroidCardImages":109,"carouselImages":115},[110,111,112,113,114],"/media/previous-section-img-main.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-1.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-2.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-3.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-4.webp",[111,112,113,114,116,117,118,119],"/media/previous-section-carousel-5.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-6.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-7.webp","/media/previous-section-carousel-8.webp","src/content/previousEditions/previousEditions.yaml","e0aedfb88c024150","reservation",["Map",122,124],{"id":122,"data":125,"filePath":173,"digest":174},{"dateOptions":126,"rooms":137,"dateRoomAvailability":166},[127,131,134],{"id":128,"label":129,"available":130},"date1","26.04-3.05.2026",true,{"id":132,"label":133,"available":130},"date2","3.05-10.05.2026",{"id":135,"label":136,"available":130},"date3","10.05-17.05.2026",[138,147,154,161],{"id":139,"name":140,"descriptions":141,"price":146,"people_count":32},"private-bedroom-shared","Private bedroom in a shared apartment ",[142,143,144,145],"A 7-night stay in a private bedroom in a two-bedroom apartment.","Shared bathroom and fully equipped kitchen (shared with 1 other guest).","All meals and drinks included (breakfast, lunch, dinner, soft drinks).","Access to workshops.",1800,{"id":148,"name":149,"descriptions":150,"price":153,"people_count":32},"private-bedroom-private-apartment","Private bedroom with a private apartment",[151,152,144,145],"A 7-night stay in a private bedroom in your own apartment.","Private bathroom and fully equipped kitchen.",2400,{"id":155,"name":156,"descriptions":157,"price":160,"people_count":35},"whole-apartment-two-bedrooms","The whole apartment with two bedrooms",[158,159,144,145],"A 7-night stay in a private two-bedroom apartment (for 2 people).","Two private bedrooms, shared bathroom and fully equipped kitchen.",4000,{"id":162,"name":163,"descriptions":164,"people_count":38},"individual-offer-group","Individual offer for bigger group reservation",[165],"If you'd like to make a reservation for a group of more than two people, please contact us – we will prepare a personalized offer.",[167,169,171],{"dateId":128,"availableRoomIds":168},[],{"dateId":132,"availableRoomIds":170},[139,148,155,162],{"dateId":135,"availableRoomIds":172},[139,162],"src/content/reservation/reservation.yaml","8c316d1691d83b33","contact",["Map",175,177],{"id":175,"data":178,"filePath":180,"digest":181},{"discordUrl":179},"https://discord.gg/P36FTt2U","src/content/contact/contact.yaml","6ba77bc958e6e990","settings",["Map",182,184],{"id":182,"data":185,"filePath":187,"digest":188},{"contactFormEmail":186,"reservationFormEmail":186},"pawel.malecki@swmansion.com","src/content/setti